        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "SECTION 13.2.1. An employee absent from his/her duties to appear in court as a witness, under subpoena, will be paid the straight rate for the scheduled time lost, providing his/her involvement does not bring discredit upon himself or the Company. Witnesses subpoenaed on behalf of the Union shall be granted time off, without pay.",
